    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d43">

                <pb facs="0152" n="82" xml:id="pg82"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72/10092 ½a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Colonel E. M. House </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-07">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">May</hi> 7, 1918</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Colonel</hi>: I saw the President today in
                    regard to the expansion and continuation of the Commission of Inquiry, of which
                    Doctor Mezes is the head. He approved thoroughly going on with the work and will
                    furnish the necessary funds. Will you be good enough to advise Doctor Mezes of
                    this and to have him let me know what additional funds are required and
                    when?</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>[File copy not signed]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
